      "content": "Starting another download clears `downloaded` but leaves `outcome` intact. After verifying backup A successfully and downloading backup B, B immediately displays A's “Backup complete” status without being verified. An in-flight verification of A can also populate B's status because Download remains enabled during verification. Clear the outcome for each new download and prevent or ignore verification results belonging to an earlier download (including pending file selection). Add regression coverage for both sequences.",
